note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note fz_dns.om: fuzz target for the DNS code of om/tls/tls.om (dns_query, dns_parse with its name
note skipping, CNAME chains and owner checks; dns_lines / dns_nsline / dns_ip4, the resolv.conf parser).
note Input: M rest. M odd: rest is resolv.conf text for dns_lines. M even: rest = H name[H] response,
note the response to dns_query(name, id 0x4f4d); a name dns_query refuses falls back to FZHOST.

fn main to int
ip = new uchar 4 0
in = new uchar FZCAP 0
n = fz_read in
if lt n 2
ret 0
end
if eq and get in 0 1 1
e = dns_lines part in 1 sub n 1 ip
ret 0
end
fz_dnsq part in 1 sub n 1
ret 0
end
